                  "__identifier": "dialog",
                  "__type": "Multilines",
                  "__value": "[\n  {\n    \"text\": \"Someone sabotaged our ship and we crashlanded here on this strange planet.  We thought maybe it was Lime, so we tossed 'em out the airlock, but the stabotage continued.  Poor ${'Lime'}...\"\n  }\n]",
